ontainer\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1478293-is-there-any-clan-characters-that-you-should-get-more-screen-time?p=1485105#post1485105\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is there an official in-game version of him?<br /> <br /> But I personally don't like most fictional depictions of the Mad Monk, they're almost to the last extremely simplistic and biased about one of the most complex and nuanced figure in the last days of the Russian Empire.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> They have a version of him in Berlin By Night who belongs to the Nosferatu clan, but the Followers Of Set/The Ministry also claim him. I also would add that I prefer that World Of Darkness don't have versions of real historical figures in general. I couldn't believe that the Ventrue have a version of Al Capone who was one of the most watched people by law enforcement and wouldn't do well as a kindred. He did love the spot light and that got him into trouble in the end.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value